      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-q/q3-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"Thus A = 75e−kt [A1] by the initial condition: [A1] At t = 2, e−2k = 33.7/75, [A1] so e−2k = 337 750 e2k = 750 337 750  2k = ln 337 k = 1 750  2 ln 337 The approximate form is A ≃75e−0.4t, and the exact model is 337 t/2 k = 1 A = 75 2 ln(750/337) ≈0.400 . [A1] 750\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
